# Files that hold a secret or that npm and the tools create locally. The only
# secret control of this public repository is the gitleaks scan of ci.yml, which
# runs after the push, so this file keeps such a file out of git add -A first
# (security audit of 2026-11-21, Watch S11). test/hygiene.test.mjs pins these
# four entries.
.env*
.dev.vars*
node_modules/
*.log
